        ['The RSVP', '03.2 &rarr; 03.4', 'Provisional on the bare link; confirmed by the code that unlocks the address; if never confirmed, the host never sees a confirmed &ldquo;in&rdquo;'],
        ['Participation versus arrangement', '03.6 &rarr; 03.7 variant', 'The dinner&rsquo;s start (eight) and Sam&rsquo;s accepted arrival are different facts; his row keeps seven-thirty and nine until he answers; hiding, muting or blocking a person never changes who is attending (Home 10 delta)'],
        ['The ongoing connection', '04.6 &rarr; 04.7', 'Ignored, declined and accepted are three endings; only accepted produces D6-B'],
        ['The boat couple', 'A separate record, inset beside 04.4', 'Email leads; the no-path branch is the same record without the door'],
